{
  "id": "grey-muster-bumku",
  "title": "The Grey Muster Comes for Bumku",
  "premise": "The Hollow Court has woken the barrows on the Teeth of Kaudru. The Grey Muster, an army of the dead, is marching on Bumku. Bumku is a port of the Baummask Moot. It has fences, not walls, and no warning. You can ride to Muru, the Red Hold, for its soldiers. They will come late, but in force. You can ride to Bumku yourself and warn it. Then hold its fences, or lead its people to the Varrn rises. Or you can burn the Bethorn crossing under the dead to buy the town time.",
